# Dependencies and Pi package caches
node_modules/
.pi/npm/
.pi/git/

# Local agent test and review artifacts
.pi/tasks/
.pi/delegate/

# Generated desktop builds
/desktop/out/
/desktop/dist/

# Credentials, personal provider configuration, and state
auth.json
models.json
models-store.json
or-models.json
trust.json
run-history.jsonl
sessions/
missions/
*.backup-*

# Local eval provider credentials (never commit keys)
.env
!.env.example

# Retired eval tasks. They are kept on disk so a result can be reproduced, but
# they are no longer in the suite and one of them carries a 5.6 MB fixture, so
# they are not worth carrying in the repository.
evals/archive/

# Eval run output. A report.json is the machine-written record of one run -- every
# attempt, every token count, every tool call -- and they run to tens of thousands
# of lines each. The repository was carrying 146k lines of them, more than the rest
# of the source put together, for files nothing reads.
#
# What is published is the derived matrix under site/evaluations/, which is committed
# and reviewable. The raw reports stay on disk so a result can still be inspected, and
# a run that backs a published claim is archived outside the repository.
#
# The two exceptions are inputs, not output: gate.mjs pins the Jev thresholds to
# jev-calibration.json and a test fails when they drift, and eval-site.mjs reads
# jev-triage.json when it builds the page. The pattern is `runs/*` rather than `runs/`
# because git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded.
evals/runs/*
!evals/runs/jev-calibration.json
!evals/runs/jev-triage.json

# SpecPi development/install state
.specpi-test/
*.log
# Eval fixtures are data, not logs. Two of the four files that decide package
# ownership in t4-scope-monorepo are .log files, and the rule above dropped
# them from the repository silently, which left that task unsolvable on a
# fresh clone while still passing every check on the machine that wrote it.
!evals/tasks/*/workspace/**/*.log
Screenshot*.png

# Editors and OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# Local planning and research notes
/PLAN.md
/docs/research/
